.TH NVPAIR-TUI 1 "September 2026" "PAIR Universal" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nvpair-tui \- operate a Personal AI Router node from a terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nvpair-tui
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B nvpair-tui
starts an
.B nvpair-ui-broker
process and displays a terminal interface for the local PAIR node.
The broker supervises discovery, proxy, engine, cluster, settings, workload,
error, and scheduling workers.
.PP
The terminal interface is intended for headless machines and SSH sessions.
It provides node, proxy, workload, engine, cluster, manual-node, settings,
error, and log views.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-broker-path " PATH"
Use the broker executable at
.I PATH
instead of looking for
.B nvpair-ui-broker
next to the TUI executable.
.TP
.BI \-log-level " LEVEL"
Set the TUI log level. Supported values are
.BR debug ,
.BR info ,
.BR warn ,
and
.BR error .
.TP
.B \-version
Print the component version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-h , " \-help"
Show command-line help and exit.
.SH KEYBOARD
.TP
.BR Tab , " Shift+Tab"
Move between views. The left and right arrow keys, or
.B h
and
.BR l ,
perform the same action.
.TP
.B ?
Toggle full keyboard help.
.TP
.BR q , " Ctrl+C"
Shut down the broker and exit.
.PP
Each view displays its available actions in the footer. While editing a field,
press Enter to submit or Escape to cancel.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/Nvidia Corporation/Personal AI Router/
Per-user settings, logs, cluster identity, and certificates.
.SH SECURITY
PAIR is designed for trusted local networks. Do not expose plaintext inference
or control endpoints to untrusted interfaces. Never publish pairing PINs,
certificate material, prompts, responses, or unsanitized logs.
.SH SEE ALSO
The PAIR documentation at https://github.com/a11q1/pair-universal/tree/main/docs,
and the upstream project at https://github.com/NVIDIA/Personal-AI-Router.
.SH BUGS
Report PAIR Universal issues at
https://github.com/a11q1/pair-universal/issues.
